; RAINBOW.LGO - colours mixed from red, green and blue
;
; SETPENCOLOR can take a list of three numbers from 0 to 255: how much
; red, green and blue to mix. Here the mix changes smoothly as the
; turtle goes round, making a colour wheel.

to wheel
  for [angle 0 359] [
    setpencolor (list 127 + 127 * cos :angle
                      127 + 127 * cos :angle - 120
                      127 + 127 * cos :angle + 120)
    penup home setheading :angle forward 60 pendown
    forward 200
  ]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setpensize 4
wheel
